  "readmeFile": "readme.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Plugin.Maui.Theme is a lightweight and extendable library for managing application-wide themes in .NET MAUI. It provides a centralized ThemeService that registers and switches between ResourceDictionary instances at runtime, allowing developers to apply styles dynamically without restarting the app.\nThe service tracks the current theme, supports initialization from existing resources, and raises a ThemeChanged event to help update the UI responsively. With a clean API and strict null checks, Plugin.Maui.Theme simplifies adaptive styling across platforms and is designed for easy integration with MVVM-based architectures and custom UI flows.",
